# The gcc release this project builds, pinned by checksum.
#
# 13.3.0 rather than el8's 8.5. Nothing here has to match the vendor's
# compiler: what el8 shipped is an input to WP-51 and WP-T4, both of which
# read vendor binaries rather than rebuild them. A 2018 gcc would cost the
# newer x86 support and a decade of fixes for no compatibility we need.
#
# The prerequisites are fetched by contrib/download_prerequisites rather than
# pinned here, which is a gap: that script verifies what it downloads against
# checksums it carries itself, so the pin exists, but it is upstream's rather
# than ours and it is not recorded in this file.

version	13.3.0
url	https://ftp.gnu.org/gnu/gcc/gcc-13.3.0/gcc-13.3.0.tar.xz
sha256	0845e9621c9543a13f484e94584a49ffc0129970e9914624235fc1d061a0c083
